{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:76f544d297ccf27d","name":"Senate Commando","source":{"id":"source:reference-76f544d297ccf27d","title":"Senate Commando","revision":20046,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:05:48Z","sha256":"01be7f855fcc533fd6eed9eee768456ad69b9029bdc865bd9392b54dfb3c4f6f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20046","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Senate%20Commando&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-76f544d297ccf27d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Senate Guard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Senate_Guard","referenceId":"reference:e0e53bb7c97f9801"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Part of an elite branch of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Senate Guard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Senate_Guard","referenceId":"reference:e0e53bb7c97f9801"},", the Senate Commandos are a special reserve unit that performs missions for both the Senate and the Judicial Department of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},". More aggressive than the defensively minded Senate Guard, the Senate Commandos act as an elite police unit on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," and sometimes travel to distant worlds on special missions. The Senate Commandos are often responsible for capturing and detaining suspects wanted by the Senate for questioning, and they frequently act as elite bodyguards for Senators traveling to war zones throughout the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Senate Commandos also serve as the bodyguards for Supreme Chancellor Palpatine, prior to the creation of the red-armored ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Royal Guards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Royal_Guards"},". The Senate Commandos wear a heavier version of the blue Senate Guard Armor, though they do not wear cloaks. The Senate Commandos are one of the few nonclone units in the Republic to perform special missions for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},", and a fierce rivalry exists between the Senate Commandos and elite clone units such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Commandos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Commandos"},". \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Senate Commando Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 6/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +17; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"t